 example:['Electric car and average sales (slides)',`<p>A car is sold with 400 km autonomy: assume the company is right: H0: autonomy = 400, H1: autonomy ≠ 400 (two-tailed).</p><p>Last year average sales were €46 per customer and you want to know <b>if they have increased</b>: the claim goes in H1: H0: amount ≤ 46, H1: amount &gt; 46 (right-tailed).</p>`],
